{"id":"sanctorale.06-27.german-speaking","source":"santos/santos_jun#0627Z","kind":"sanctoral","items":[{"text":{"*":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"[In den Diözesen deutscher Sprache]"}]]}]},"part":"title","role":"rubric"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"h2","lines":[["27. Juni"],["Hl. Hemma von Gurk"]]}]},"part":"title"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"p","lines":[["Hemma (emma), Gräfin von Friesach-Zeltschach, geboren um 980, mit dem Grafen Wilhelm von der Sann verheiratet, schien zu Glück und Ehre berufen. Aber durch unglückliche Umstände verlor sie früh ihren Mann und ihre beiden Söhne. Sie nahm ihr hartes Geschick als Fügung Gottes an und nutzte ihr Vermögen und den Rest ihres Lebens, um Gutes zu tun. Sie wurde dem Volk von Kärnten eine sorgende Mutter. Auf ihrem Besitz stiftete sie das Doppelkloster Gurk. Auch das Kloster Admont verehrt sie als Stifterin. Sie starb 1045 in Gurk."]]}]},"part":"title"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Commune-Texte für heilige Frauen:"}],[{"m":"link","t":"1","to":"common.holy-men-and-women.14"},{"m":"link","t":"2","to":"common.holy-men-and-women.15"}],[{"m":"rubric","t":"."}]]}]},"part":"title"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Tagesgebet"]]}]},"part":"collect"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"p","lines":[["Barmherziger Gott, du lenkst unsere Wege. In schwerer Zeit hat die heilige Hemma (als Landesmutter von Kärnten) für die Bedrückten und Armen gesorgt. Gib auch uns die Kraft, in der Not nicht zu verzweifeln, sondern auf dich zu schauen und Gutes zu tun. Darum bitten wir durch Jesus Christus."]]}]},"part":"collect"},{"slot":"149","text":{"la":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Præfatio"]]}],"pt-BR":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Prefácio"]]}],"en-US":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Preface"]]}],"es":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Prefacio"]]}],"it":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Prefazio"]]}],"fr":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Préface"]]}],"de":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Präfation"]]}]},"part":"preface","suggested":true},{"slot":"150","text":{"la":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"De sanctis"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"... Qui in Sanctórum concílio celebráris,...","to":"preface.52"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"... Tu enim Sanctórum tuórum confessióne...","to":"preface.53"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"pt-BR":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Dos Santos"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"...Na assembleia dos Santos...","to":"preface.52"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"...Pois, pelo testemunho admirável...","to":"preface.53"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"en-US":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"SAINTS"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"... For you are praised in the company...","to":"preface.52"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"... For in the marvellous confession of...","to":"preface.53"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"es":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Santos"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"... Porque eres glorificado en la asamblea...","to":"preface.52"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"... Porque mediante el testimonio admirable de tus santos...","to":"preface.53"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"it":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"DEI SANTI"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"... Nella festosa assemblea dei santi...","to":"preface.52"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"... Nella testimonianza di fede dei tuoi santi...","to":"preface.53"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"fr":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Des Saints"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"... Car tu es glorifié dans l'assemblée des saints...","to":"preface.52"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"... Tu ne cesses de fortifier ton Église...","to":"preface.53"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"de":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"HEILIGEN"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"... Die Schar der Heiligen verkündet...","to":"preface.52"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"... Denn in den Heiligen schenkst du der Kirche...","to":"preface.53"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}]},"part":"preface","suggested":true}],"precedence":12.0,"prefaces":["preface.52","preface.53"],"commons":["common.holy-men-and-women.14","common.holy-men-and-women.15"],"title":{"*":"Hl. Hemma von Gurk"}}
